    "detailed_description": "Support English, bilingual subtitles!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/7ea79eb08035220b7c58d4d97880783e.poster.avif?t=1695027275\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/7ea79eb08035220b7c58d4d97880783e.webm?t=1695027275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/7ea79eb08035220b7c58d4d97880783e.mp4?t=1695027275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022 Collect kitten fans<br>\u2022 Stealing followers from other cats<br>\u2022 Gather as many followers as possible<br>\u2022 Dodge puppy attacks<br><br>Hold the mouse still to control your cat. Run up to unclaimed kittens and let them follow you, or run up to cats that follow fewer kittens than you and steal their kittens. At the end of the round, the cat with the most followers wins. Dodging puppy attacks.<br><br>Thanks for the technical support of our cat &quot;Huahua&quot;!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/38c85751317049ccce3085663dbe51c4.avif?t=1695027275\" width=230 height=500 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/b814f7be8c4830036a21cfea529323d3.avif?t=1695027275\" width=374 height=500 /></span><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Support English, bilingual subtitles!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/7ea79eb08035220b7c58d4d97880783e.poster.avif?t=1695027275\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/7ea79eb08035220b7c58d4d97880783e.webm?t=1695027275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/7ea79eb08035220b7c58d4d97880783e.mp4?t=1695027275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022 Collect kitten fans<br>\u2022 Stealing followers from other cats<br>\u2022 Gather as many followers as possible<br>\u2022 Dodge puppy attacks<br><br>Hold the mouse still to control your cat. Run up to unclaimed kittens and let them follow you, or run up to cats that follow fewer kittens than you and steal their kittens. At the end of the round, the cat with the most followers wins. Dodging puppy attacks.<br><br>Thanks for the technical support of our cat &quot;Huahua&quot;!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/38c85751317049ccce3085663dbe51c4.avif?t=1695027275\" width=230 height=500 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571420/extras/b814f7be8c4830036a21cfea529323d3.avif?t=1695027275\" width=374 height=500 /></span><br>",
